19. Concomitant other malignancies ≤5 years prior to enrollment, except adequately treatable carcinoma in situ of the cervix, basal cell or squamous epithelial cell skin cancer, localised prostate cancer, and ductal carcinoma;
20. Serious physical or mental illnesses or laboratory abnormalities. Any condition which, in the opinion of the Investigator, may be detrimental to the subject or result in the subject's inability to meet or perform the requirements of the study.

