1. Prior allergy to cyclophosphamide, fludarabine and interleukin-2 contraindications or to any component of the infusion product formulation or to other drugs to be used during the study (antibiotics, human serum albumin, dextran 40, etc.);
2. Any NCI CTCAE5.0 immune-related adverse reaction (irAE) grade \&amp;gt;3 that has been permanently discontinued during any previous immunotherapy;
