Inclusion Criteria:

* (1) patients aged between 18 and 35 years ;
* (2) Body Mass Index (BMI) lower than 30kg/m² ;
* (3) alcohol consumption less than 4 unit per day ;
* (4) tabacco use less than 6 cigarettes per day ;
